{"scope":"knowledge","page":8,"pageSize":24,"total":200,"totalPages":9,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f92c76362096","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"漫剧关键帧视觉词表","description":"项目视觉方向接受为漫剧 / 二维漫画形态后，写关键帧 `generic_prompt` 的人会撞上同一个 问题：身份、地理、边界事实都绑好了，但“这一帧怎样投影已接受的画风、当前镜头要防什么 可读性风险”每次都要重新发明措辞，同一个项目里不同集的提示词各说各话。这份词表把 项目级画风基底与镜头级可选词分开，让同一项目复用一份视觉语言，又不把镜头差异抹平。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/comic-keyframe-lexicon.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f9ff5da55c2e","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"FAQ 速查","description":"来源：https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a0ed1ce40280804f5db5417 （2026-08-13 13:37）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/qa.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fa380e636c02","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"角色 / 画面一致性（短剧最难的技术点）","description":"> 本文件只管**外貌/画面一致性**（同一角色跨镜跨集长相不崩）。 > 角色的**内在深度**（行动模型 / want·need·wound·flaw / 弧光 / 可跟随四问 / 台词区分度）见 > `story-engine.md` + `dialogue-craft.md`——那才是治「人物扁平」的地方，别混淆。 > > AI 生成的最大痛点：同一角色在不同镜头/不同集里长相会变。业界共识的解法是 > **「先定角色参考图，再图生视频(I2V)，而非纯文生视频」**…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/character-consistency.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fa61e52d15c0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Seedance 2.0 提示词方言","description":"只在目标档案明确写 `target_video_model: seedance-2.0` 时使用。推荐档案：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/seedance-2.0.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fe26ce8791ec","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"改编压缩、合并与信息视觉化","description":"改编不是把原文缩短，也不是为短剧补一套流行结构。目标是保留原材料真正承担的戏剧功能， 再为屏幕、单集边界和制作条件寻找新的载体。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/adaptation-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fe90b2e9ef35","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"规则与路由索引","description":"本文件只做两件事：把每类决策路由到**负责的技能**，以及定义规则分级与冲突优先级。 它不复制任何规则正文——每个技能的预检、所有权边界、形态输入与完整规则表，都在该技能 自己的 `references/stage-contract.md` 里。核心不代子技能决定读哪一份资料。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/knowhow-index.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ff953def97d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Character / Look 设计","description":"1. 分工 2. Character：最小稳定识别集 3. Look：一次相容的外观组合 4. 可选声音方向：身份锚点不等于本场 delivery 5. 制作形态与身份锚点的可表达性 6. 合成例：顾禾 7. 角色 设定集 的实用检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/character-and-look.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skil